<title>UK: TABLE-Trinity Int profit surges.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Trinity Int profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 29,1996</p>
<p>			    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		28.3		   vs 21.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.2		    vs n/a</p>
